><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.6em 0.6em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now, we can write our equation as\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"77\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-