      "name": "Question 18",
      "problem": "What is the trace in the $xy$-plane of the sphere $(x-1)^{2}+(y+3)^{2}+{z}^{2}=9?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the trace in the $xy$-plane, we substitute $z=0$ into the equation of the sphere:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-1)^{2}+(y+3)^{2}+(0)^{2} & =9 \\\\ (x-1)^{2}+(y+3)^{2} & =9\\end{aligned}\n$$",
