    "q-71947": {
      "dom_id": "step-q71947",
      "name": "Question 19",
      "problem": "What is the trace in the $yz$-plane of the sphere $(x-4)^{2}+{y}^{2}+(z+1)^{2}=25?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the trace in the $yz$-plane, we substitute $x=0$ into the equation of the sphere:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(0-4)^{2}+{y}^{2}+(z+1)^{2} & =25 \\\\ 16+{y}^{2}+(z+1)^{2} & =25 \\\\ {y}^{2}+(z+1)^{2} & =9\\end{aligned}\n$$",
